<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's Alkimia has higher '96 profits.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's Alkimia has higher '96 profits.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemical firm Alkimia had a 7.629 million dinars provisional net profit in 1996, up by 8.71 percent from a revised 7.076 million dinars in 1995, results showed on Friday.</p>
<p>Turnover was 44.99 million dinars in 1996, up by 21.79 percent from 36.94 million dinars in 1995.</p>
<p>Alkimia, which manufactures and trades chemical inputs for detergents, has a capital of 17.096 million dinars.</p>
<p>It is listed at the Tunis Stock Exchange where its share was last priced 45 dinars. ($=1.08 dinar)</p>
</text>
